  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing and Strengthening the Agricultural Production of the Communities Affiliated with the Indigenous Association oguero Pave&apos;i</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institucin Ecumnica de Promocin Social (OGUASU), $61,650 over 12 months OGUASU will continue to train 1,000 Myba Paraguayans in the organic cultivation of traditional crops, reforestation, beekeeping, aquaculture, animal husbandry and conservation. It will increase demonstration plots, develop plans for five communities to sell surplus production, and support the participation of oguero Pave&apos;i1, an indigenous association, in the formation of an education council to improve indigenous involvement in curriculum development and other decisions that affect local schools. (PY-199-A3)</narrative>
  </description>
